{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A demon approaches the protagonist Kai during a night walk, who gives him one hour to decide whether or not to give the demon his most precious memory in exchange for freedom from worldly pain. During this little time you are given, will you choose to keep Kai's memories and deal with the pain of waking life? Is it better to sacrifice what is precious to him and escape reality? Or will he continue to wander the streets, searching for answers in the dark where strange beings await him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427370/extras/1d1abc1b9983849f54ca631988eb4f8f.avif?t=1767969971\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427370/extras_big/1d1abc1b9983849f54ca631988eb4f8f.webp?t=1767969971 width=1560 height=457 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a third-person adventure in which you take a timed night walk. Explore a reactive and surreal neighborhood where reality bends and spirits lurk in the shadows. Converse with other lost wanderers and reclaim hope in a bleak world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will determine your ending.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3427370?t=1767969971","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3427370?t=1767969971","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427370/fbb98ebc6d77734befa7883b4f2a965aecddc08b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767969971","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427370/fbb98ebc6d77734befa7883b4f2a965aecddc08b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767969971","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"descripti